# Agent workflow

- One concern per PR (content ≠ CMP ≠ generator UX ≠ docs). Branch from latest `main` as `cursor/<name>-1fce`. Open PR; do not merge unless asked.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` standing rules and the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/` before inventing a new process.
- Pre-merge gate: `npm test && npm run audit` (see `pre-merge-seo-aeo-checklist`).
